# Shell 脚本必须保持 LF：CRLF 会让 macOS/Linux 的 bash 直接报 bad interpreter
*.sh text eol=lf
# ---- 行尾钉死：Windows 脚本必须 CRLF（.bat 的 label/goto 在 LF 下会断）----
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

# ---- 二进制钉死：防止未来 text 规则误转换 ----
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.db binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
